  "content": "\n\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sBkjBpG.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"268\"></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fvoidomon-s-wolf-pack%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#36f;text-decoration:underline\">Planet Minecraft 連結 </span></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此材質包為狼新增了數種不同的紋理，讓它們像貓一樣有更多變化！不過其中一些比較特別，具有&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">不同的稀有度。（請查看下方的圖片！）</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LvazVqb.png\" width=\"654\" height=\"740\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YKl9JFf.png\" width=\"652\" height=\"81\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此材質包需要 <strong>Entity Texture Features</strong> 模組或 <strong>Optifine</strong> 才能運作。<br><span style=\"color:#f00\">缺少它們將無法正常運作</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/42Rsg68.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"165\"></span></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.optifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bbNKjIb.png\" width=\"180\" height=\"165\"></span></a></span></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>若您使用的是 Optifine，請確保以下設定已開啟：</strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">影片設定 &gt; 品質<br>&gt; 隨機實體：開啟&nbsp;<br>&gt; 發光紋理：開啟&nbsp;</div>\n<p><br><br></p>",
